    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Powerful Stench",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "olfactory"
      ],
      "text": "30 feet. A creature that enters the area must attempt a DC 34 Fortitude save save. On a failure, the creature is Sickened 2, and on a critical failure, the creature is also Slowed 1 for as long as it is sickened. While within the aura, the creature takes a -2 circumstance penalty to saves to recover from the sickened condition. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune to all xulgaths' stenches for 1 minute.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "unsupported",
          "foundry": {
            "key": "Aura",
            "radius": 30,
            "slug": "powerful-stench",
            "traits": [
              "olfactory"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Intimidating Strike",
      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "rage"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger Zashathal hits a creature with a melee Strike\n\n---\n\nEffect Zashathal makes an Intimidate check to demoralize the target creature. If the target creature was reduced to 0 Hit Points by the triggering Strike, Zashathal can instead Demoralize all opponents within 30 feet by comparing the result of his Intimidation check to each creature's Will DC. Zashathal doesn't take a penalty to these Intimidation checks for not speaking a target's language."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Rage",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "emotion",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements Zashathal isn't Fatigued or raging\n\n---\nEffect Zashathal gains 20 temporary Hit Points that last until the rage ends. While raging, he deals 12 additional damage with melee attacks and takes a -1 penalty to AC. Zashathal can't use concentrate actions except Seek and rage actions. The rage lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies Zashathal can perceive, or until Zashathal falls Unconscious. Once the rage ends, Zashathal can't again for 1 minute.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "modifier",
          "selector": "ac",
          "type": "untyped",
          "value": -1,
          "when": [
            "self:effect:rage"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "modifier",
          "selector": "strike-damage",
          "type": "untyped",
          "value": 12,
          "when": [
            "self:effect:rage"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "unsupported",
          "foundry": {
            "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
            "mode": "override",
            "path": "flags.system.rageTempHP",
            "value": 20
          }
        }
      ]
    },
